option.WATER_PRESET=Water Preset
option.WATER_PRESET.comment=Selects an Episode Two 2007 above-water and beneath-water VMT pair.
value.WATER_PRESET.0=EP2 Riverbed 01
value.WATER_PRESET.1=EP2 Riverbed 02
value.WATER_PRESET.2=EP2 Silo
value.WATER_PRESET.3=EP2 Tunnels

option.WATER_NORMAL_MODE=Normal Animation
option.WATER_NORMAL_MODE.comment=Source 2007 uses the Episode Two static normal with three UV flows. Source 2004 uses the original 29-frame normal at 30 FPS with one classic UV flow.
value.WATER_NORMAL_MODE.0=Source 2007
value.WATER_NORMAL_MODE.1=Source 2004

option.WATER_QUALITY=Water Quality
option.WATER_QUALITY.comment=Selects Source's automatic distance blend, $forceexpensive, or $forcecheap surface path.
value.WATER_QUALITY.0=Source Automatic
value.WATER_QUALITY.1=Force Expensive
value.WATER_QUALITY.2=Force Cheap

option.SSR_QUALITY=Reflection Quality
option.SSR_QUALITY.comment=SSR Off keeps Source's cheap envmap fallback. All Off removes every surface reflection like a potato preset. Other modes control Minecraft's screen-space substitute for Source's planar reflection render target.
value.SSR_QUALITY.3=SSR Off
value.SSR_QUALITY.4=All Off (Potato)
value.SSR_QUALITY.0=Performance
value.SSR_QUALITY.1=Balanced
value.SSR_QUALITY.2=High

option.SSR_RESOLUTION=Reflection Resolution
option.SSR_RESOLUTION.comment=Controls the resolution of Minecraft's screen-space substitute for Source's planar reflection render target.
value.SSR_RESOLUTION.0=0.25x
value.SSR_RESOLUTION.1=0.5x
value.SSR_RESOLUTION.2=0.75x
value.SSR_RESOLUTION.3=1.0x

option.EXPENSIVE_WATER_DISTANCE=Expensive Water Distance (Chunks)
option.EXPENSIVE_WATER_DISTANCE.comment=Automatic mode stays expensive until the final chunk, blends across that chunk, and becomes fully cheap at the selected distance.

option.CHEAP_WATER_FRESNEL_F0=Cheap Water Fresnel Floor
option.CHEAP_WATER_FRESNEL_F0.comment=Minimum envmap response for Minecraft's missing local cubemaps. 0.0 is the exact Source formula; 0.04 is physical water F0.

option.REFRACTION_MULTIPLIER=Refraction Multiplier
option.REFRACTION_MULTIPLIER.comment=Multiplies the selected VMT $refractamount. 1.0 is the shipped value.

option.REFLECTION_MULTIPLIER=Reflection Multiplier
option.REFLECTION_MULTIPLIER.comment=Multiplies the selected VMT reflection contribution. 1.0 is the shipped value.

option.WATER_NORMAL_SCALE=Normal Map Tiling
option.WATER_NORMAL_SCALE.comment=Controls how often the animated water normal map repeats across the surface.

option.WATER_SPEED_MULTIPLIER=Water Speed Multiplier
option.WATER_SPEED_MULTIPLIER.comment=Scales all shipped VMT UV scroll rates. 1.0 uses Source time directly.

option.REFLECTION_OVERBRIGHT=Reflection Overbright
option.REFLECTION_OVERBRIGHT.comment=Applies Source-style reflection overbright when refraction blur is enabled.

option.SURFACE_REFRACTION_BLUR=Surface Refraction Blur
option.SURFACE_REFRACTION_BLUR.comment=Adds optional blur to the water surface. The selected Episode Two VMTs ship with this disabled.

option.UNDERWATER_OVERLAY_MULTIPLIER=Underwater Overlay Multiplier
option.UNDERWATER_OVERLAY_MULTIPLIER.comment=Multiplies water_warp01 $refractamount .04. Riverbed 02 intentionally has no overlay.

option.UNDERWATER_OVERLAY_SCALE=Underwater Overlay Scale
option.UNDERWATER_OVERLAY_SCALE.comment=Controls the screen-space scale of the animated underwater normal map.
